 "scenes": [
  {
   "id": "open",
   "chapter": "",
   "type": "open",
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Go to sleep with issues. Wake up with pull requests.",
     "start": 1.6,
     "dur": 3.495
    },
    {
     "text": "This is Shep: the night shift for your backlog.",
     "start": 5.475,
     "dur": 2.937
    }
   ],
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 9.892
  },
  {
   "id": "problem",
   "chapter": "The idea",
   "type": "problem",
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Coding agents are great. But today, you sit and watch them work.",
     "start": 9.992,
     "dur": 3.994
    },
    {
     "text": "You babysit terminals, answer prompts, and re-run failing builds.",
     "start": 14.366,
     "dur": 4.145
    },
    {
     "text": "Shep is built for the other moment: coming back to finished work.",
     "start": 18.891,
     "dur": 3.367
    }
   ],
   "start": 9.292,
   "end": 23.737
  },
  {
   "id": "states",
   "chapter": "The idea",
   "type": "states",
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "The idea is simple. In the evening, you hand Shep tasks.",
     "start": 23.837,
     "dur": 3.622
    },
    {
     "text": "Each task moves through five states.",
     "start": 27.839,
     "dur": 2.276
    },
    {
     "text": "Queued. Working. Then Ready, or Needs you. And finally, Merged.",
     "start": 30.495,
     "dur": 4.748
    },
    {
     "text": "That's the whole product.",
     "start": 35.623,
     "dur": 1.277
    }
   ],
   "start": 23.137,
   "end": 38.38
  },
  {
   "id": "handover",
   "chapter": "Evening \u00b7 hand it over",
   "type": "handover",
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Handing work over looks exactly like what you already do.",
     "start": 38.48,
     "dur": 3.471
    },
    {
     "text": "In Linear or Jira, add the shep label, or move the ticket to Tonight.",
     "start": 42.331,
     "dur": 4.063
    },
    {
     "text": "In Slack, react with a sheep on any message.",
     "start": 46.775,
     "dur": 2.984
    },
    {
     "text": "On GitHub, label the issue. Or just type it: shep add, and a sentence.",
     "start": 50.139,
     "dur": 5.445
    },
    {
     "text": "You can even tell your coding agent: give this to Shep for tonight.",
     "start": 55.964,
     "dur": 3.541
    }
   ],
   "start": 37.78,
   "end": 60.985
  },
  {
   "id": "ack",
   "chapter": "Evening \u00b7 hand it over",
   "type": "shots",
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Shep answers right where you asked.",
     "shot": {
      "img": "SignalThread",
      "from": [
       20,
       140,
       720,
       330
      ],
      "to": [
       30,
       160,
       640,
       290
      ]
     },
     "start": 61.085,
     "dur": 2.171
    },
    {
     "text": "Got it. I'll work on this tonight at eleven. No new inbox to check.",
     "start": 63.636,
     "dur": 4.238
    }
   ],
   "start": 60.385,
   "end": 69.354
  },
  {
   "id": "night",
   "chapter": "Night \u00b7 the shift",
   "type": "night",
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "At eleven, the shift starts.",
     "start": 69.454,
     "dur": 1.962
    },
    {
     "text": "Your own coding agent, like Claude Code or Codex, works each task in its own copy of the code, so your work in progress is never touched.",
     "start": 71.796,
     "dur": 8.824
    },
    {
     "text": "The sky is the progress bar. It starts at midnight blue, and warms toward dawn as each task finishes.",
     "start": 81.0,
     "dur": 6.548
    },
    {
     "text": "Every finished task is a sheep walking into the pen.",
     "start": 87.928,
     "dur": 3.158
    }
   ],
   "start": 68.754,
   "end": 92.566
  },
  {
   "id": "trouble",
   "chapter": "Night \u00b7 the shift",
   "type": "trouble",
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "If a build fails, Shep reads the log and fixes it.",
     "start": 92.666,
     "dur": 3.495
    },
    {
     "text": "If a task is unclear, it asks one question, and moves on to the next.",
     "start": 96.541,
     "dur": 4.261
    },
    {
     "text": "And it never wakes you up.",
     "start": 101.181,
     "dur": 1.335
    }
   ],
   "start": 91.966,
   "end": 103.997
  },
  {
   "id": "glance",
   "chapter": "Night \u00b7 the shift",
   "type": "shots",
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Curious at two in the morning? The Dynamic Island shows the shift at a glance.",
     "shot": {
      "img": "MacSystem",
      "from": [
       370,
       40,
       540,
       420
      ],
      "to": [
       400,
       70,
       470,
       360
      ]
     },
     "start": 104.097,
     "dur": 4.807
    },
    {
     "text": "Or open the terminal, and watch the sky.",
     "shot": {
      "img": "Watch",
      "from": [
       0,
       0,
       1040,
       800
      ],
      "to": [
       20,
       20,
       1000,
       560
      ]
     },
     "start": 109.284,
     "dur": 2.426
    }
   ],
   "start": 103.397,
   "end": 113.19
  },
  {
   "id": "morning",
   "chapter": "Morning \u00b7 review",
   "type": "shots",
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "In the morning, one notification: five ready, one needs you.",
     "shot": {
      "img": "MacSystem",
      "from": [
       840,
       250,
       460,
       260
      ],
      "to": [
       860,
       290,
       420,
       200
      ]
     },
     "start": 113.29,
     "dur": 3.889
    },
    {
     "text": "Open the review window. Every pull request is a draft that already passes its checks.",
     "shot": {
      "img": "MacReview",
      "from": [
       0,
       0,
       1280,
       820
      ],
      "to": [
       120,
       20,
       1160,
       660
      ]
     },
     "start": 117.559,
     "dur": 5.445
    },
    {
     "text": "Proof comes first: a screenshot of the change, and a second opinion from a reviewer agent.",
     "shot": {
      "img": "MacReview",
      "from": [
       200,
       60,
       1080,
       520
      ],
      "to": [
       230,
       300,
       900,
       300
      ]
     },
     "start": 123.384,
     "dur": 5.19
    }
   ],
   "start": 112.59,
   "end": 130.054
  },
  {
   "id": "decide",
   "chapter": "Morning \u00b7 review",
   "type": "decide",
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "You decide with one key. M to merge. S to send it back, with a note.",
     "start": 130.154,
     "dur": 4.714
    },
    {
     "text": "Shep never merges on its own. You always press the button.",
     "start": 135.248,
     "dur": 3.622
    }
   ],
   "start": 129.454,
   "end": 140.35
  },
  {
   "id": "inplace",
   "chapter": "Morning \u00b7 review",
   "type": "shots",
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "The answer also lands where the task came from. The Slack thread gets the pull request, and a Merge button.",
     "shot": {
      "img": "SignalThread",
      "from": [
       20,
       360,
       720,
       420
      ],
      "to": [
       30,
       380,
       660,
       380
      ]
     },
     "start": 140.45,
     "dur": 6.269
    },
    {
     "text": "The ticket moves to In review.",
     "shot": {
      "img": "SignalThread",
      "from": [
       720,
       80,
       700,
       440
      ],
      "to": [
       740,
       100,
       640,
       380
      ]
     },
     "start": 147.099,
     "dur": 1.834
    },
    {
     "text": "Your teammates see it happen. That's how Shep spreads through a team.",
     "shot": {
      "img": "SignalThread",
      "from": [
       20,
       560,
       720,
       360
      ],
      "to": [
       30,
       600,
       640,
       320
      ]
     },
     "start": 149.314,
     "dur": 3.959
    }
   ],
   "start": 139.75,
   "end": 154.753
  },
  {
   "id": "dawn",
   "chapter": "Morning \u00b7 review",
   "type": "shots",
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Clear the queue, and the sky reaches full dawn.",
     "shot": {
      "img": "MacDawn",
      "from": [
       140,
       120,
       1000,
       640
      ],
      "to": [
       0,
       0,
